* CD4520B dual 4-bit synchronous binary up-counter - behavioral ngspice model
*
* Unofficial mixed-signal (XSPICE) model for KiCad / ngspice.
* Behavior, per section:
*   - counts on CLOCK rising edge while ENABLE is high
*   - also counts on ENABLE falling edge while CLOCK is low
*     (internally: count on the rising edge of CLOCK OR NOT ENABLE)
*   - RESET high asynchronously clears Q1..Q4 to 0
*   - power-up state is 0000
* Input thresholds track the supply: logic 1 above (VDD-VSS)*vth_hi,
* logic 0 below (VDD-VSS)*vth_lo (default 45% / 55%, i.e. about half supply).
* Outputs swing VSS..VDD through rout (default 400 ohm, roughly the
* datasheet drive at 10-15 V) with trise/tfall edges.
* Not modeled: propagation delay vs. supply, supply current, input
* protection diodes, max clock frequency.
*
* Node order follows the package pin numbers 1..16:
*   1=CLKA 2=ENA 3=Q1A 4=Q2A 5=Q3A 6=Q4A 7=RSTA 8=VSS
*   9=CLKB 10=ENB 11=Q1B 12=Q2B 13=Q3B 14=Q4B 15=RSTB 16=VDD
*
* KiCad Sim.Pins field (map each symbol pin number to these names):
*   1=CLKA 2=ENA 3=Q1A 4=Q2A 5=Q3A 6=Q4A 7=RSTA 8=VSS
*   9=CLKB 10=ENB 11=Q1B 12=Q2B 13=Q3B 14=Q4B 15=RSTB 16=VDD

.subckt CD4520B CLKA ENA Q1A Q2A Q3A Q4A RSTA VSS CLKB ENB Q1B Q2B Q3B Q4B RSTB VDD
+ params: rout=400 tdelay=100n trise=50n tfall=50n vth_lo=0.45 vth_hi=0.55

X_A CLKA ENA RSTA Q1A Q2A Q3A Q4A VSS VDD CD4520B_HALF
+ rout={rout} tdelay={tdelay} trise={trise} tfall={tfall} vth_lo={vth_lo} vth_hi={vth_hi}
X_B CLKB ENB RSTB Q1B Q2B Q3B Q4B VSS VDD CD4520B_HALF
+ rout={rout} tdelay={tdelay} trise={trise} tfall={tfall} vth_lo={vth_lo} vth_hi={vth_hi}

.ends CD4520B


* One counter section (internal helper)
.subckt CD4520B_HALF CLK EN RST Q1 Q2 Q3 Q4 VSS VDD
+ params: rout=400 tdelay=100n trise=50n tfall=50n vth_lo=0.45 vth_hi=0.55

* Keep unconnected inputs from floating (CMOS inputs are high-impedance)
Rpc CLK VSS 1e12
Rpe EN  VSS 1e12
Rpr RST VSS 1e12

* Normalize inputs to 0..1 of the supply span, then convert to digital
Bnc nclk 0 V = V(CLK,VSS)/max(V(VDD,VSS),1m)
Bne nen  0 V = V(EN,VSS) /max(V(VDD,VSS),1m)
Bnr nrst 0 V = V(RST,VSS)/max(V(VDD,VSS),1m)
Aadc [nclk nen nrst] [dclk den drst] adc4520
.model adc4520 adc_bridge(in_low={vth_lo} in_high={vth_hi})

* Count trigger = CLK OR NOT EN
Ainv den den_n inv4520
Aor  [dclk den_n] dtrig or4520
.model inv4520 d_inverter(rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n)
.model or4520  d_or(rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n)

* Synchronous binary counter from toggle flip-flops
Ahi  dhi pullup4520
.model pullup4520 d_pullup
Aa12 [dq1 dq2]     t3 and4520
Aa13 [dq1 dq2 dq3] t4 and4520
.model and4520 d_and(rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n)
Aff1 dhi dtrig NULL drst dq1 dq1n tff4520
Aff2 dq1 dtrig NULL drst dq2 dq2n tff4520
Aff3 t3  dtrig NULL drst dq3 dq3n tff4520
Aff4 t4  dtrig NULL drst dq4 dq4n tff4520
.model tff4520 d_tff(clk_delay={tdelay} reset_delay={tdelay} ic=0
+ rise_delay=1n fall_delay=1n)

* Digital -> 0..1 V, then rail-tracking output stage with output resistance
Adac [dq1 dq2 dq3 dq4] [o1 o2 o3 o4] dac4520
.model dac4520 dac_bridge(out_low=0 out_high=1 out_undef=0.5
+ t_rise={trise} t_fall={tfall})
Bo1 q1i 0 V = V(VSS) + V(o1)*V(VDD,VSS)
Bo2 q2i 0 V = V(VSS) + V(o2)*V(VDD,VSS)
Bo3 q3i 0 V = V(VSS) + V(o3)*V(VDD,VSS)
Bo4 q4i 0 V = V(VSS) + V(o4)*V(VDD,VSS)
Ro1 q1i Q1 {rout}
Ro2 q2i Q2 {rout}
Ro3 q3i Q3 {rout}
Ro4 q4i Q4 {rout}

.ends CD4520B_HALF
